BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 56 665 Td (Celery Beat scans expired orders once per minute. Expired unpaid orders are cancelled,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 56 651 Td (active payment attempts are closed, and stock is restored once.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 56 632 Td (The cancellation is recorded in the order timeline. The customer's cart remains available) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 56 618 Td (for a new order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 48 599 Td (Expiry and payment callbacks lock the payment attempt before the order and recheck the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 48 585 Td (current state inside a transaction. This prevents a callback that has already completed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.15 0.21 0.27 rg 48 571 Td (from being cancelled a second time.) Tj ET
